OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist and fog patches should
OL,6,Fsoon clear, leaving a fine day with
OL,7,Flight winds and long spells of
OL,8,Fsunshine, although skies may be hazy
OL,9,Fat times. Feeling warm in places by
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and largely clear
OL,13,Fevening, but cloud will gradually
OL,14,Fbuild from the south overnight,
OL,15,Fbecoming widespread and perhaps
OL,16,Fbringing a few spots of drizzle by
OL,17,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
