OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FRather dull with outbreaks of
OL,6,Flight rain and drizzle, though
OL,7,Fbecoming drier and brighter in the
OL,8,Fafternoon with some sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping from the south later.
OL,10,FTurning warm and breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fwith rain on Wednesday, locally heavy,
OL,14,Fclearing to sunny spells. Sunny spells
OL,15,Fand scattered showers on Thursday,
OL,16,Flocally heavy. Breezy with afternoon
OL,17,Fshowers on Friday. Temperatures closer
OL,18,Fto average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
